<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 40px 0;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
    }
    .card {
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      padding: 40px 32px;
    }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #444444;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .body-text {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #777777;
      margin: 0 0 24px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .button-wrapper {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 32px 0;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .link-fallback {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #a9a9a9;
      word-break: break-all;
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .link-fallback a {
      color: inherit;
    }
    .footer {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #a9a9a9;
      margin: 32px 0 0;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="card">
      <p class="greeting">Hi <%= @user.display_name_or_username %>,</p>
      <p class="body-text">Your granblue.team account is scheduled to be deleted on <strong><%= @deletion_date %></strong>. You've been signed out everywhere.</p>
      <p class="body-text">Until then, your account and teams stay as they are. If you change your mind, log in and choose <strong>Cancel deletion</strong>.</p>
      <div class="button-wrapper">
        <a href="<%= @login_url %>" class="button" style="background-color: <%= @element_color %>;">Log in to cancel</a>
      </div>
      <p class="footer">If you didn't ask to delete your account, log in, cancel the deletion, and change your password right away.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
